@1 = ~By the gods! You... you have this beautiful piece of fabric. I wanted to have it so much, I... Here, take these spell scrolls. My husband was a mage. He died, and I have no use for them anymore. Here.~
@2 = ~It's yours. Please, take it.~
@3 = ~I'd rather keep it for now.~
@4 = ~Good day to you, friends.~
@5 = ~Oh, how I wish I had that beautiful fabric from the north in my house. But it costs so much. It's practically highway robbery.~
@6 = ~I hope you find some someday.~
